{"title":"1997 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/6/f361efa9ea92a34219e05e0825907161f273f17a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/4/814c514770281c68a41854d522aee1e6d29a17ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x)(x^2)(\\frac{1}{x})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/c/28c6148fbc114ed39885e45863b5cfed161fd42e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ -8\\frac{1}{2} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ -4 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ -8 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"477\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simply plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/6/f361efa9ea92a34219e05e0825907161f273f17a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> into the expression, and see what we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/7/6370177ebddd821918caa53c1ddfbd09ffafd929.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x)(x^2)(\\frac{1}{x}) = (-2)((-2)^2)(\\frac{1}{-2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"249\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/b/4dbee3cc9a9ba7dd3379d00b0ee9aabd07874f50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=-2 \\times 4 \\times \\frac{1}{-2} = -8 \\times \\frac{1}{-2} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"302\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simplify this, and then plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/6/f361efa9ea92a34219e05e0825907161f273f17a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> into the expression:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/e/f8ee2211d3e6404d4c65d2625318bb92fc636225.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x)(x^2)(\\frac{1}{x}) = x \\times x^2 \\times \\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"198\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/6/016a87a18fdb2e307813e412e3ff90bcf6f53753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=x^3 \\times \\frac{1}{x} = x^2 = (-2)^2 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"267\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017190549\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 47/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1870/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:32652:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017190549 and revision id 251847. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}